Package: sondavi
Title: Read Your Own Study Data from the Sondavi Survey Platform
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Max Planck Institute for Human Development", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "arc-support@mpib-berlin.mpg.de")
Description: Reads responses and variable metadata of your own studies from the
    Sondavi survey platform's read-only data API, so an analysis does not have to
    start with an exported file. Applies the study's codebook, so categorical
    questions arrive as factors with their real labels rather than as character
    columns, and can record a citable snapshot of the exact set a result was
    computed from.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: httr2, jsonlite, utils
Suggests: tibble
URL: https://github.com/MPIB/sondavi-r
BugReports: https://github.com/MPIB/sondavi-r/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
